{"id":"dd853b7af4d47abc","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-pbroofexistence.md","title":"Roof线性majorant与强持久性的存在陈述","display":"thm-pbroofexistence — Roof线性majorant与强持久性的存在陈述","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-pbroofexistence","aliases":["27-thm-pbroofexistence"],"display":"thm-pbroofexistence — Roof线性majorant与强持久性的存在陈述","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbpersistency]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"13.6.1","source_printed_pages":"595","source_pdf_pages":"619","verification_status":"local-constant-witness-verified-original-source-not-rechecked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-pbroofexistence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-pbroofexistence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pbroofexistence — Roof线性majorant与强持久性的存在陈述"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b041170088bcba26\" href=\"?note=b041170088bcba26\" title=\"27-df-pbpersistency\">27-df-pbpersistency</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"13.6.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"595"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"619"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-constant-witness-verified-original-source-not-rechecked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall S\\subseteq[n]\\;(|S|&gt;2\\Rightarrow c_f(S)=0)\">\\(\\forall S\\subseteq[n]\\;(|S|&gt;2\\Rightarrow c_f(S)=0)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_f,\\rho(f)\">\\(c_f,\\rho(f)\\)</span> 沿 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b041170088bcba26\" href=\"?note=b041170088bcba26\" title=\"27-df-pbpersistency\">27-df-pbpersistency</a> 的书内依赖取得。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RoofWitness}\">\\(\\mathrm{RoofWitness}\\)</span> 仅取该定义中给定的证书谓词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell^f\">\\(\\ell^f\\)</span> 由下式构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell^f\\in\\mathbb R^{\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}},\\qquad\n\\ell^f_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\rho(f)&amp;i=0,\\\\0&amp;i\\in[n].\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell^f\\in\\mathbb R^{\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}},\\qquad\n\\ell^f_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\rho(f)&amp;i=0,\\\\0&amp;i\\in[n].\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RoofWitness}(f,\\ell^f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RoofWitness}(f,\\ell^f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb R^{\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}}\\quad\\mathrm{RoofWitness}(f,\\ell).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb R^{\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}}\\quad\\mathrm{RoofWitness}(f,\\ell).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条沿用上传文本的证书接口；它的弱存在陈述可直接用常数线性函数证明。任意布尔点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 配上 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y_{ij}=x_ix_j\">\\(y_{ij}=x_ix_j\\)</span> 都在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal Q_n\">\\(\\mathcal Q_n\\)</span> 中，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)\\le\\rho(f)\">\\(f(x)\\le\\rho(f)\\)</span>；所构造线性函数的最大值正好为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho(f)\">\\(\\rho(f)\\)</span>，全部非常数系数为零，其系数符号条件逐项成立。因此上述 Assertion 不需要书外证明。</p>\n<p>原元数据所指 p.595 的具体 roof 构造与强持久性理论，本轮没有原书 PDF 或被引论文可重新核对。本条不据弱证书的常数见证声称已经重建该理论，也不由此给出任何非空的固定变量集。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbpersistency","status":"resolved","id":"b041170088bcba26","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbpersistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbpersistency","status":"resolved","id":"b041170088bcba26","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$ 满足 $\\forall S\\subseteq[n]\\;(|S|>2\\Rightarrow c_f(S)=0)$；$c_f,\\rho(f)$ 沿 [[27-df-pbpersistency]] 的书内依赖取得。$\\mathrm{RoofWitness}$ 仅取该定义中给定的证书谓词。$\\ell^f$ 由下式构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall S\\subseteq[n]\\;(|S|>2\\Rightarrow c_f(S)=0)","display":false},{"tex":"c_f,\\rho(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RoofWitness}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell^f","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell^f\\in\\mathbb R^{\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}},\\qquad\n\\ell^f_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\rho(f)&i=0,\\\\0&i\\in[n].\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RoofWitness}(f,\\ell^f).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb R^{\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}}\\quad\\mathrm{RoofWitness}(f,\\ell).","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"y_{ij}=x_ix_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal Q_n","display":false},{"tex":"f(x)\\le\\rho(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho(f)","display":false}],"bytes":1911,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-144","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-pbroofexistence|thm-pbroofexistence — Roof线性majorant与强持久性的存在陈述]]"}],"outgoing":["b041170088bcba26"]}